But the moment they walk out the door, tomorrow is a better day to do it. And many of them just never complete their intended action. One of the pernicious forms of friction we discussed earlier Lauren was reactants. We often respond like small children when someone suggests something to us. Our first reaction is often to object even if it's something we might like or at least eventually like. Researchers in Germany, the Netherlands and Luxembourg once tried different methods to get

